  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU CSO strategi 2025-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU CSO strategy 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program support to PMU for cooperation with civil society partners in 17 countries, including Pentecostal movements and NGO:s for rights-based development initiatives within several sectors - minority rights, education, health, business development etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xf6;d till PMU f&#xf6;r samarbete med civilsamh&#xe4;llespartners i 17 l&#xe4;nder, varav pingstr&#xf6;relser och NGO:er f&#xf6;r r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserad utvecklingssarbete inom flera sektorer - minoriteters r&#xe4;ttigheter, utbildning, h&#xe4;lsa, sm&#xe5;f&#xf6;retagsutveckling mm.</narrative>
  </description>
